     [38;2;220;90;90m[48;2;61;1;0m 256 -  [38;2;248;248;242mbundling. If a future source digitises shared roads differently, this is where it degrades.[69X[38;2;220;90;90m[5;6H 257 -[38;2;248;248;242m- **Per line, not per shape.** A line's outbound and inbound shapes form one strand: each edge of[65X[38;2;220;90;90m[6;6H 258 -  [38;2;248;248;242ma line is drawn exactly once, whichever direction it comes from. Where a direction diverges[69X[m
